{"name":"Morning Glory","hex":"#9ed1d3","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"morning glory","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Any of several members of the family Convolvulaceae; climbing plants with trumpet shaped flowers.","An involuntary erection present upon waking."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/morning_glory"}],"entries":[{"title":"Morning Glory (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Morning Glory is an American punk rock band from New York City. It was formed originally as a solo project by Ezra Kire in 2001 after his band Choking Victim disbanded in 1998."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/74/Ezra_Kire_-_MG-5099.jpg/330px-Ezra_Kire_-_MG-5099.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Morning_Glory_(band)"},{"title":"Morning glory","blocks":[{"text":"Morning glory is the common name for over 1,000 species of flowering plants in the family Convolvulaceae, whose taxonomy and systematics remain in flux. These species are distributed across numerous genera, including:"},{"items":["Argyreia","Astripomoea","Calystegia","Convolvulus","Ipomoea","Lepistemon","Merremia","Operculina","Rivea","Stictocardia"]}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/90/Ipomoea_tricolor_%27Heavenly_Blue%27.jpg/330px-Ipomoea_tricolor_%27Heavenly_Blue%27.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Morning_glory"},{"title":"Morning","blocks":[{"text":"Morning is either the period from sunrise to noon, or the period from midnight to noon. In the first definition it is preceded by the twilight period of dawn, and there are no exact times for when morning begins because it can vary according to one's latitude, and the hours of daytime at each time of year. However, morning strictly ends at noon, when afternoon starts."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commo